**/build
**/.cache
__pycache__
out/
*_wave.bin
dist/
*.spec
resources/bin/*
!resources/bin/.gitkeep
# libusb-1.0.dll 可内置入库随项目分发（LGPL 允许）：Windows 工位免装依赖。
# pyusb 会优先加载它（见 device_watch.libusb_backend）。放好后 git add -f 亦可。
!resources/bin/libusb-1.0.dll

# 固件与工厂产测专用资源：只在工位本地放置，禁止入库/公开
# 每产品目录 resources/products/<id>/：product.toml + programmer.toml 公开入库，
# firmware/ 下的镜像/密钥为工厂本地，禁止入库/公开。
resources/products/*/firmware/*.bin
resources/products/*/firmware/*.fs
# eFuse AES 密钥（机密，绝不入库）
resources/products/*/firmware/*.ekey
resources/products/*/firmware/efuse_key.txt

